      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s0",
      "source_id": "43fe893c-fe5c-45f9-83a0-149a2444cf1b",
      "text": "That's helpful — I like the idea of keeping things simple and focused. I guess the key is to have a clear goal but stay open to adjusting how I get there. I'll make sure to pack only what's essential and have a few backup options ready. Thanks for the advice!"
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s1",
      "source_id": "4496cf95-0894-423a-95bb-1a1a9872680b",
      "text": "You're very welcome! Focusing on those priorities and keeping options open is usually the best way to handle travel. Have a wonderful trip!"
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s2",
      "source_id": "ade05c3f-b1bb-4259-bdd3-b2d06d5e6518",
      "text": "You're welcome! I'll try to stay flexible but also keep my plans tight. I appreciate the support!"
    },
